        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "-Spacious 5 Bedroom 4 Bathroom Family Home\r\n\r\n-Custom Designed & Built in 2000\r\n\r\n-Large West Facing Back Garden\r\n\r\n-Perfect For Both Indoor And Outdoor Entertaining\r\n\r\n-Private And Secure Parking For Multiple Vehicles\r\n\r\n\r\nPremium Collection are proud to present this exceptional private and spacious detached five bedroom and four-bathroom family residence only a short distance from Monkstown Village. Set back from the road and constructed in 2000, this Alfie Jones custom designed gem is accessed through elegant wrought iron gates into a front garden flanked by 6-7ft high walls providing private and secure parking for multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\nInside the home is both sophisticated and inviting.  Upon entering from the veranda porch through to the main entrance hall, convenient access is provided to each of the main living spaces from this central point and one gets a clear sense of cozy spaciousness and light throughout. Immediately to your left, two large double doors invite you into an impressive living room with a marble open feature fireplace and sizeable recessed bay window. At the heart of the ground floor is a magnificent dual aspect kitchen/dining room which is filled with natural light through multiple expansive south facing windows and floor to ceiling glass patio doors offering wonderful views of the large west facing back garden. Comprising a striking kitchen island and a significant amount of bespoke shaker style cabinetry, this spacious kitchen is ideal for entertaining and family gatherings with granite countertops, large range cooker, dual sinks, separate utility room and walk-in larder. Another set of double doors lead from the kitchen/dining room through to a large family room with a second feature fireplace, wood burning stove and glass patio doors. The sense of space and free flowing floorplan becomes apparent. Combined with a large downstairs bathroom and adjacent cloakroom, there is nothing left wanting on the ground floor.\r\n\r\nAscending the feature staircase, the first floor comprises 4 well-appointed bedrooms, a home office and main family bathroom all accessed from the spacious central landing. The generous master bedroom has a range of fitted wardrobes together with a bright en-suite bathroom with south facing window. Thoughtful design features such as transom windows over the bedroom doors and two large windows in the staircases ensure that natural light fills every space on both levels. The 2nd floor provides for a spacious 5th bedroom with shower room en-suite and multiple skylight windows together with a fully enclosed wardrobe closet.\r\n\r\nOutside to the front, there is private and secure parking together with an EV charging point. In addition there is a substantial lawn area comprising mature trees and planted bedding. The large west facing rear garden is ideal for entertaining with a magnificent lawn and large stone tiled patio ideal for al fresco dining all enclosed by a combination of high walls and mature hedging which ensures a sense of privacy and tranquility. Behind the walk-in larder lies a secure lockable storage area accessed externally which coupled with the outside garden shed ensures that there is no lack of storage space available in this home with further storage under the stairs and also within the eaves.\r\n\r\nThe specification is of the highest quality both inside and out with granite sills, double glazing throughout, recessed lighting, solid white oak architraves, doors and flooring downstairs and Spanish tile flooring in the kitchen. In addition, the systems include Devi underfloor heating in the main bathroom and ensuite, smart electric meter, dual zoned heating system with Hive controller, built in central vac throughout and a water pressure booster pump system.\r\n\r\nThis much sought-after location combines desirability with exceptional convenience being only a short walk from Monkstown village with its boutique shops, restaurants and cafes.  The frequent buses to Dun Laoghaire, Dundrum and Dublin and the DART at Salthill provide ready access to all parts of the city.  In addition, its proximity to numerous first, second and third level schools and colleges and numerous sporting facilities ensure that every phase of life is catered for in abundance.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and we look forward to showing you around.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
